  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>EN</strong>：</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這是遊玩「<strong>Lordran - Modded Adventure</strong>」地圖所<strong>必需</strong>的<strong>官方模組包</strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">其中包含多款<strong>黑暗時代</strong>與<strong>中世紀風格</strong>的模組，所有內容皆<strong>基於</strong>《<strong>黑暗靈魂</strong>》三部曲的遊戲玩法設計。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">官方<strong>地圖下載連結</strong>如下：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252flordran-dark-souls-v-06%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/lordran-dark-souls-v-06/</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（目前地圖<strong>僅提供</strong><strong>義大利文</strong>與<strong>英文 Alpha 版本</strong>）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模組包</strong>與<strong>地圖</strong>由 <strong>Bigbelloboss89</strong> 製作</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>SpeedArt</strong> 由 <strong>Tesla2k</strong> 提供（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252f1J2X3X72kEA\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/1J2X3X72kEA</a>）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由 <strong>giordangattocraft</strong> 上傳至 CurseForge</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>IT</strong>：</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此為遊玩「<strong>Lordran - Modded Adventure</strong>」地圖所<strong>必需</strong>的<strong>官方模組包</strong>。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">內含多款以<strong>中世紀</strong>與<strong>黑暗時代</strong>為主題的<strong>模組</strong>，整體設計<strong>基於</strong>《<strong>黑暗靈魂</strong>》三部曲的遊戲機制。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">官方<strong>地圖下載連結</strong>如下：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252flordran-dark-souls-v-06%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/lordran-dark-souls-v-06/</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（目前地圖<strong>僅提供</strong><strong>義大利文</strong>與<strong>英文 Alpha 版本</strong>）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模組包</strong>與<strong>地圖</strong>由 <strong>Bigbelloboss89</strong> 製作</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>SpeedArt</strong> 由 <strong>Tesla2k</strong> 提供（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252f1J2X3X72kEA\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/1J2X3X72kEA</a>）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由 <strong>giordangattocraft</strong> 上傳至 CurseForge</span></p>",
